{"id":"000VNH","title":"No Entry","author":"reima","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-22T01:35:15+00:00","posted":"Heute, 03:10 Uhr","rules":"Normal sudoku rules apply: Put the digits 1 to 9 once each in every row, every column, and every 3x3 box.\n\nAntiknight: Any two cells separated by a knight's move in chess cannot contain the same digit.\n\nAntiking: Any two cells separated by a king's move in chess cannot contain the same digit.\n\nModular lines: Any three consecutive cells on a red modular line must contain digits with different remainders when dividing by 3. I.e. one digit must be from the set {1, 4, 7}, one from the set {2, 5, 8}, and one from the set {3, 6, 9}.\n\nXV: Any two cells joined by an X must contain digits summing to 10. Any two cells joined by a V must contain digits summing to 5. Not all X or V are necessarity given (no negative constraint).\n\nKropki dots: Any two cells joined by a black dot must contain digits with a ratio of 1:2 (one must be double the other). Not all dots are necessarily given (no negative constraint).\n\nPlay in SudokuPad.","solutionCode":"Row 9","tags":["Sudoku","Non-Touching (Variante)","Anti-Knight (Variante)","XV (Variante)","Kropki Pairs (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/f1d8aa1zr0","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/f1d8aa1zr0","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-22T01:35:15+00:00"}